{"code": 1, "data": {"content": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1708227169044.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">2月12日，正月初三。在北京市昌平区回龙观街道龙乡社区，记者跟随假期值班的快递小哥刘久，记录下他坚守岗位的服务过程。&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1708227179220.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #95a5a6; font-size: 14px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">△7点，刘久在分拣货品。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1708227195716.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #95a5a6; font-size: 14px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">△8点，刘久分拣完货品，为当天的配送做准备。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1708227201735.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #95a5a6; font-size: 14px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">△10点，刘久将快递送到顾客手中。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1708227210224.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #95a5a6; font-size: 14px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">△11点，刘久在社区的暖心驿站休息。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">新春佳节，万家团圆。在这喜庆的日子里，有许许多多人坚守岗位，用担当诠释责任，用行动守望幸福，成为节日里亮丽的风景。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">习近平总书记指出，辛勤劳作的农民，埋头苦干的工人，敢闯敢拼的创业者，保家卫国的子弟兵，各行各业的人们都在挥洒汗水，每一个平凡的人都作出了不平凡的贡献！</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">恪尽职守，心系家国。让我们聚焦节日里坚守岗位、默默奉献的平凡英雄，记录下他们辛勤守望的最美身姿。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #95a5a6; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: #c91623;\">■</span> 本文来源：人民日报</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #95a5a6; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">人民日报记者陈斌摄影报道</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1708227284588.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>", "contentAbstract": "", "contentCode": "content01853", "contentTitle": "人民日报点赞假期坚守岗位的京东快递小哥", "contentType": 2, "createTime": 1708225388000, "id": 4147, "isDelete": 0, "link": "", "linkType": 0, "projectName": "京东物流官网", "srcUrl": "/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1708227250033.jpg", "updateTime": 1710383721000}}